---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../data/config.json";
import faqs from "../../data/faqs.json";
const meta = {"url": "/corporate-glass-awards/", "title": "Corporate Glass & Crystal Awards with Your Logo | Grimes Engravers", "description": "Corporate glass and crystal awards engraved with your logo for staff awards nights, long service and events. Cardiff engravers since 1947, UK delivery, orders from 2 awards."};
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description} path={meta.url} faqs={faqs["corporate-glass-awards"]} scripts={[]}>
<section class="coll-hero-scene" style="--scene: url(/assets/img/collections/corporate-awards.webp); background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem">
<div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 3rem">
<div style="flex: 0 1 40rem; min-width: 0">
<p style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 1rem; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23263A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px">Minimum order 2 awards</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #F3A3A6; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase">Glass &amp; crystal awards</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.12">Engraved glass &amp; crystal awards for companies</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #D1D5DB">Bespoke engraved glass and crystal awards for staff awards nights, long service and events, with a minimum order of 2 awards. Add the awards you like to your order and we’ll confirm the price, with a free proof, within 24 hours.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem">
<a href="/glass-awards/" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #23263A; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px">Choose your awards</a>
<a href="/contact/" style="border: 2px solid #9CA3AF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Tell us what you need</a></div>
<ul style="margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem; color: #E5E7EB; font-weight: 600"><li>✓ Your logo engraved</li><li>✓ Free proof</li><li>✓ Nothing to pay today</li><li>✓ Invoice and PO numbers welcome</li></ul></div>
</div><span class="ai-tag">AI illustration</span></section>
<div data-christmas-panel="corporate-glass-awards" style="padding: 0 1.5rem"></div>
<section aria-label="Minimum order" style="background: #FFF8E6; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1E2B8; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem">
<p style="margin: 0; color: #1F2933; font-size: 1.15rem"><strong>Minimum order: 2 glass awards in total.</strong> Mix and match different awards and sizes.</p>
<a href="/glass-awards/" style="background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 6px">Order now</a></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Glass awards companies order from us</h2><p style="margin: 0 0 2rem; color: #4B5563; max-width: 44rem">Repeat work for some of Cardiff’s largest employers, year after year.</p><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Glass &amp; crystal awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Staff awards, sales awards and recognition pieces, engraved with your logo.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Long service awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Engraved glass awards for 10, 20 and 25 years’ service.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Sponsors &amp; VIPs</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass pieces to thank sponsors, partners and volunteers.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Event &amp; sponsorship awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass awards for sponsored events, tournaments and charity days.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Not in the catalogue?</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Send us the idea for a bespoke glass piece and we’ll tell you what’s possible.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #F5F6F7; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 3rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Catalogue &amp; pricing</h2><p style="margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #4B5563">Browse our glass and crystal catalogue and add the awards you like to your order. The prices shown are per award. Engraving is £10.50 per position plus a flat £40 setup per order, with bulk discounts that may apply.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 1rem"><a href="/glass-awards/" style="display: inline-block; background: #3D5A5E; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.8rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Browse glass awards</a></p></div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0"><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Minimum 2</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass award orders start at 2 awards in total, and you can mix different awards and sizes.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Plus engraving</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Catalogue prices are for the award only. Engraving is £10.50 per award, plus a flat £40 setup per order.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Price and proof in 24 hours</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">On working days, Monday to Friday. Nothing to pay until you approve your proof.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">10–14 working days</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">From your approval of our proof.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">How an order works</h2><ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">1</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Add awards to your order</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Choose your awards online (2 or more), then add your wording, logo and date at checkout. Logos as PDF, EPS or SVG work best.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">2</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Price and proof in 24 hours</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">One price for the whole order, including engraving.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">3</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Approve your proof</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">We email a proof of the engraving for you to sign off, then ask for a deposit or full payment. Purchase orders welcome.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">4</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Delivered together</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Ready 10–14 working days after you approve the proof.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><div style="max-width: 48rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Frequently asked questions</h2><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0" open=""><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Is there a minimum order?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Glass award orders start at 2 awards in total, and you can mix different awards and sizes. For memorial and bench plaques there’s no minimum.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Are the catalogue prices final?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Catalogue prices are per item. Engraving is £10.50 per position plus a flat £40 setup per order. They’re guide prices; bulk discounts may apply, confirmed in your quote.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Can you use our company logo?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Yes. Send it as a PDF, EPS or SVG and we’ll set it up for engraving.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">How far ahead should we order?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">We confirm your price within 24 hours (working days), and awards are ready 10–14 working days after you approve our proof. Allow at least 3–4 weeks before your event.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Can we reorder the same item next year?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Yes. We keep your artwork and specification on file, so repeat orders match exactly.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #3D5A5E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 24rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600">Planning an awards night?</h2><p style="margin: 0; color: #E5ECEC">Add your awards to your order and we’ll confirm the price, with a free proof, within 24 hours. Nothing to pay today.</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem"><a href="/glass-awards/" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px">Order now</a>
<a href="mailto:info@grimesengravers.com" style="border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Email us</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
